{"repositoryId":1423721521,"availability":"available","full":"ManagementMO/greenlight","name":"greenlight","description":"Evidence-grounded contractor cash decisions, fine-tuned clause extraction, and a measured agent improvement loop.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-17T20:36:56Z","updated":"2026-10-18T02:29:38Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://greenlight-two-psi.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://greenlight-two-psi.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:02:56.060Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T03:02:56.060Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T03:02:56.060Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T03:02:56.060Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Can we accept this $120,000 job without borrowing or missing payroll?","Greenlight turns that question into a traceable cash decision: the bottleneck, the evidence that could change it, and the smallest supported payment adjustment. Its MetaHarness measures improvements to repeated evidence processing while the financial engine remains fixed.","The application includes an interactive cash bridge, source evidence, bounded what-if controls, conserved funding proposals, and an improvement lab. The public demonstration runs deterministic calculations and displays recorded genuine provider experiments. It does not start paid inference or GPU jobs when someone visits or clicks Replay."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManagementMO/greenlight/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a5140d2bbc735533bf96c9f65980be7fa947daa57d115f25b90f4addba9ff3f1","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T03:02:56.364Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:02:56.364Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Can we accept this $120,000 job without borrowing or missing payroll?","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManagementMO/greenlight/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","s